{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10645050","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10645050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1064505001:1":{"text":"シルフィス様、やはりあなたなのですね……再びお会いできるなんて、夢にも思いませんでした……","source_cn":"奥菲戈斯女士，真的是您……我从没想过还能再见到您……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB50370C1A98F9E4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064505002:1":{"text":"も、もしお許しいただけるなら……残りの人生も、あなたのために音楽を奏でさせてください。もう弦を弾けなくなる、その日まで！","source_cn":"若、若您同意，请允许我将余生的乐声献给您，直到我无力拨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD11BAF7866F2969C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064505003:1":{"text":"バルトーク先生。あなたの演奏は、すでに人の心を動かすに足るものです。","source_cn":"巴托克先生，你的演奏技艺，已足以令人动容。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC86DCB472382FA04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064505004:1":{"text":"怪我や恐怖、混乱の中にあってなお調和を守り抜いたこと――それは、どのような完璧な技術より尊いものですわ。","source_cn":"但在深陷伤病、恐惧与失序的时刻，仍能守住和谐之声，这比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF604A3ACDCBC7E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064505005:1":{"text":"この大地には、今も雑音に苦しむ人々が大勢います。わたくしではなく、彼らこそあなたの旋律を必要としているのではないですか？","source_cn":"这片大地，仍有诸多受困于杂音的凡人，相比于我，他们更需...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x316D591B9B82A7A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064505006:1":{"text":"シルフィスは丁寧に羽根を整え、一切の乱れがないことを確認すると、金色の冠羽から一本を抜き取り、バルトークに手渡した。","source_cn":"奥菲戈斯仔细梳理羽毛，确认少去一支仍不显凌乱后，从金色...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1FD10CE34CEECAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064505007:1":{"text":"どの羽根にも、それぞれ収まるべき場所があります。そしてその一枚は、あなたに託すべきものですわ。","source_cn":"每根羽毛，都有它应在的位置，而这一支，理应交由你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D7EF155C28626D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064505008:0":{"text":"そう言い残し、シルフィスは静けさを取り戻した街を歩き去っていった。","source_cn":"随后，奥菲戈斯收拢羽翼，沿着复归宁静的街道缓步离去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x001D79D52B4A29A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1064505009:0":{"text":"数年後――ボーン歌劇場。","source_cn":"数年后，波恩城大剧院内","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A968D383C7E330F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064505010:0":{"text":"おーい……バル……ク……先生！","source_cn":"巴……克……喂——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBDEE3467DAAA05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064505011:0":{"text":"リハーサルに集中するバルトークを見て、ディッチはその傍らへ歩み寄り、声を張り上げた。","source_cn":"见巴托克仍在专注地排演着乐曲，蒂奇走到巴托克身侧，提高...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FEDF32C17538DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064505012:0":{"text":"……ディッチさん？","source_cn":"……蒂奇？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4574243E4A051F43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064505013:0":{"text":"もう夜も更けるぞ！そんなに無理するな。あんたは人類の宝なんだからな！","source_cn":"这都后半夜了！再这么熬下去，保不齐哪天人类可要失去他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDEFF9E46D2D4DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064505014:0":{"text":"インスピレーションなんか、そう簡単に湧いてくるもんじゃない！ほら、もう寝ろよ、バルトーク先生！","source_cn":"灵感这东西，又不是说来就来的。快去睡吧，巴托克先生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8362BBE252216C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064505015:0":{"text":"……わかった、わかった。もう少ししたら休むよ。","source_cn":"……好的，好的。我一会儿就休息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F04D2E609B80E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title